  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h1 class="display reveal">Buy verified <span class="text-fade">B2B leads</span> by niche, as CSV</h1>
        <p class="lede reveal">Ready-to-use datasets with emails, phone numbers, and websites, verified before delivery. Subscribe monthly or buy one-time across <span class="text-fade">19+ niches</span>.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions reveal">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="bundles.html">Browse datasets</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-meta reveal">Every dataset includes</p>
        <div class="field-chips reveal">
          <span class="chip">Email</span>
          <span class="chip">Phone</span>
          <span class="chip">Website</span>
          <span class="chip">Location</span>
          <span class="chip">Ratings</span>
          <span class="chip">Competitors</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="band" id="pricing">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>One flat price. <span class="text-fade">No credits.</span></h2>
          <p class="lede">Buy a <span class="text-fade">single dataset</span> or subscribe for monthly delivery. No per-record charges, no software seats.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pricing-grid">
          <div class="pricing-card reveal">
            <span class="pricing-card__name">One-time dataset</span>
            <span class="pricing-card__price">$7.99 <span>per dataset</span></span>
            <p class="pricing-card__desc">A single niche dataset. No commitment, no subscription.</p>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="bundles.html">See all niches</a>
          </div>
          <div class="pricing-card pricing-card--featured reveal">
            <span class="pricing-card__name">Membership <span class="member-perk">Best value</span></span>
            <span class="pricing-card__price">$19.99 <span>/mo</span></span>
            <p class="pricing-card__desc">Discounted datasets, priority requests, and more.</p>
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="membership.html">Compare plans</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="band reveal" id="how-it-works">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Three steps to <span class="text-fade">verified leads</span></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="steps">
          <article class="step">
            <span class="step-index">01</span>
            <h3>Pick a niche</h3>
            <p>19+ verticals, each dataset built specifically for that market.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="step">
            <span class="step-index">02</span>
            <h3>Choose a plan</h3>
            <p>One flat price. Buy once or subscribe for monthly delivery.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="step">
            <span class="step-index">03</span>
            <h3>Use it today</h3>
            <p>Download a CSV and open it in Excel, Sheets, or any CRM.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal" id="niches">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Browse by <span class="text-fade">niche</span></h2>
          <p class="lede">The market is bigger than your network. Choose an industry, get straight to the businesses that matter.</p>
