    <section id="faq">
      <div class="wrap faq-section">
        <h2 class="faq-heading">FAQ.</h2>
        <p class="faq-subtitle">For the ones who want to lead.</p>
        <div class="faq-list reveal">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a1">
              What is LeadsPitch?
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 7.5l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-a" id="faq-a1"><div class="faq-a-text">
              We deliver verified B2B leads as CSV datasets across 19+ niches. Subscribe monthly or buy one-time. Each file includes business names, emails, phones, websites, locations, and more.
            </div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a2">
              How is this different from Apollo or ZoomInfo?
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 7.5l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-a" id="faq-a2"><div class="faq-a-text">
              Those are searchable software platforms with credit systems. LeadsPitch gives you a finished CSV, no software, no credits, no dashboard to learn.
            </div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a3">
              Is the data verified?
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 7.5l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-a" id="faq-a3"><div class="faq-a-text">
              Yes. Every dataset is sourced and verified before delivery. Where a field can't be confirmed, we leave it blank rather than include unverified data.
            </div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a4">
              How much does LeadsPitch cost?
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 7.5l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-a" id="faq-a4"><div class="faq-a-text">
              Prices vary by niche and dataset size. One-time datasets start at a flat rate. Monthly plans include a discount and fresh data delivered automatically.
            </div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a5">
              What data fields are included?
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 7.5l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-a" id="faq-a5"><div class="faq-a-text">
              Each CSV typically includes business name, email, phone, website, address, city, state, rating, review count, and more depending on the niche.
            </div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a6">
              How often is the data updated?
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 7.5l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-a" id="faq-a6"><div class="faq-a-text">
              Every dataset is built from scratch at the time of purchase or subscription renewal. You always get fresh, current data.
            </div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a7">
              Can I request a custom niche?
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 7.5l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-a" id="faq-a7"><div class="faq-a-text">
              Yes. If your niche isn't listed, contact us and we'll build a custom dataset for your specific market.
            </div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="muted faq-more">More questions? <a class="link-inline" href="faq.html">See all FAQs</a> or <a class="link-inline" href="contact.html">contact us</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="band reveal">
